BENCHMARK MATERIAL

The public benchmark measurements in README.md and CITATION.cff use the Human Detectors
repository at the revision and file hash recorded in
docs/research/frontier-benchmark-results.json. Users obtain the upstream data
under its own terms; this repository ships only aggregate results and an
offline benchmark reproduction harness.


