sloptrim-zh

This project is a modified version of sloptrim by Seyed Ehsan Hadi
(https://github.com/seyedehsanhadi/sloptrim, commit
38dbb7cb4e97de0b9bf157903c95bdcab016dda2), licensed under Apache-2.0.

Changes made in sloptrim-zh:
  - scripts/detect.py is distributed unchanged.
  - scripts/detect_zh.py is new: a Chinese pattern layer, Chinese rhythm
    metrics, a lyrics mode, and Chinese-context zero-width cleanup. It imports
    and reuses detect.py for file reading, code stripping, the character layer
    and score confidence.
  - SKILL.md and references/patterns-zh.md are new Chinese texts written for
    this project. references/patterns-en.md is the upstream
    references/patterns.md, unchanged apart from its file name.
  - Hooks, plugin packaging, benchmarks, recordings and assets of the
    upstream project are not included.

The Chinese pattern catalogue follows the localisation approach and the
Chinese-specific checkpoints (layered 的, 进行+verb, stacked 被, four-character
parallelism, 随着……的发展 openers, formula endings) of Humanizer-zh by 歸藏
(https://github.com/op7418/Humanizer-zh), licensed under the MIT License. Its
license text is reproduced in references/HUMANIZER-ZH-LICENSE.txt. All worked
examples in sloptrim-zh are original.

sloptrim-zh is not affiliated with or endorsed by the sloptrim or
Humanizer-zh authors.
